{"4561970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "STORMY", "steam_appid": 4561970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique augmented reality adventure using just a sheet of paper and a webcam through Stormy’s innovative AR(Augmented Reality) Controller—or play with standard controls like keyboard and gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1148 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Meet Stormy, a friendly, quirky robot on a mission to rescue a lost ally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pilot a vast array of imaginative spacefaring vehicles—each with its own unique design—as you journey across a vibrant planetary system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mine resources, cultivate alien lifeforms, grow plants, raise fish, race vehicles and robotic horses, and take on missions ranging from taxi and cargo runs to epic battles. Every planet offers new adventures, discoveries, and opportunities as you continue your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Looking for competition? Arena Mode lets up to four players battle and race together on the same PC in fast-paced local multiplayer matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cosmic adventure where every mission, every creation, and every race brings you closer to saving your friend… and shaping your destiny among the stars.<br> <br>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique augmented reality adventure using just a sheet of paper and a webcam through Stormy’s innovative AR(Augmented Reality) Controller—or play with standard controls like keyboard and gamepad. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1148 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/c72ccdf8d43703ee5385bf1ea3974a85.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Meet Stormy, a friendly, quirky robot on a mission to rescue a lost ally.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/bd9521a2edf71f5cc82b74af1566624f.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pilot a vast array of imaginative spacefaring vehicles—each with its own unique design—as you journey across a vibrant planetary system.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/f451cf64e8d11f7854d94e749d3d8987.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Mine resources, cultivate alien lifeforms, grow plants, raise fish, race vehicles and robotic horses, and take on missions ranging from taxi and cargo runs to epic battles. Every planet offers new adventures, discoveries, and opportunities as you continue your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.poster.avif?t=1786579601\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.webm?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/extras/fbc908a22c73da602ea889df7ba92463.mp4?t=1786579601\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Looking for competition? Arena Mode lets up to four players battle and race together on the same PC in fast-paced local multiplayer matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a cosmic adventure where every mission, every creation, and every race brings you closer to saving your friend… and shaping your destiny among the stars.<br> <br>  </p>", "short_description": "Turn a sheet of paper into your controller using your webcam, or stick to standard controls. Journey across a vast planetary system to save your lost ally while piloting spaceships, exploring as a robot, fighting, trading, racing, mining, and cultivating life forms.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4561970/7797cef20d